{"id":"barrie_re","lemma":"barrière","pos":"noun","rank":3370,"glosses":["barrier"],"ipa":"/ba.ʁjɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/a/a9/Fr-barri%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-barri%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"barrières"},"formAudio":{"barrières":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/c/c5/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-barri%C3%A8res.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"J'ai dû ramper sous la barrière.","en":"I had to crawl under the fence.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to crawl, worm"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"J'ai peint la barrière en vert.","en":"I painted the fence green.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to paint","l":"peindre"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"green"}]},{"text":"Le jardin était entouré par une barrière en bois.","en":"The garden was surrounded by a wooden fence.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/26049","words":[{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"garden"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"to surround","l":"entourer"},{"g":"through"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / of it"},{"g":"wood"}]},{"text":"Nous devons travailler dur à abattre les barrières sociales.","en":"We must work hard to break down social barriers.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to work"},{"g":"hard, tough"},{"g":"to / at"},{"g":"to butcher"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"social","l":"social"}]},{"text":"La barrière avait besoin d'un coup de peinture.","en":"The fence needed painting.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"need"},{"g":"of / from"},null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"painting"}],"phrases":[[5,7,"once, one time"]]}]}